      "content": "(Sighing deeply, tapping a quill against the parchment) Truly, one finds the sheer chaos of native governance unsustainable. Our presence brings an orderly administration and the steady hand of law where only rampant custom previously reigned. We introduce modern infrastructure and a framework of civility, lifting a vast population from cycles of unproductive strife. It is a divinely ordained duty to bring civilization and prosperity to this subcontinent.",
